WARFRAME Wiki data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data derived from the WARFRAME Wiki (https://wiki.warframe.com) is licensed
under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 3.0 license
(CC BY-NC-SA 3.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/), as is
the wiki itself. This applies to these files:

  gamedata/incarnon.json        (Incarnon evolution perks)
  gamedata/factions.json        (faction damage-type modifiers)
  reference/enemies.json        (representative enemies and level scaling)
  reference/archon_shards.json  (Archon Shard bonuses)
  reference/riven_factors.json  (Riven stat factors)

These files contain names and numeric values only, extracted from wiki pages
by the WARFRAME Wiki contributors. Each file records its source pages and
retrieval date. Damage formulas implemented in the code follow the wiki pages
"Damage/Calculation", "Calculating Bonuses" and "Status Effect".

Builds computed and served by this project use these wiki-derived values, so
the computed build data is also shared under CC BY-NC-SA 3.0.
